Package: kelpbio
Title: Bayesian Kelp Biomass Estimation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seb", "Dalgarno", , "seb@poissonconsulting.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3658-4517")),
    person("Tula Foundation", role = c("fnd", "cph"))
  )
Description: Estimate wet, dry, and carbon biomass of Nereocystis
    luetkeana and Macrocystis pyrifera kelp beds from in situ surveys and
    canopy imagery, with compatibility intervals from Bayesian
    hierarchical models fitted by 'rstan'. The Stan models are
    pre-compiled, so no Stan installation is needed.
